Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20260811133753.1742666-6-nitin.r.gote@intel.com
Signed-off-by: Tejas Upadhyay <tejas.upadhyay@intel.com>
(backported from commit b7501c4fd941a9f8e7c8a4d073658b4a49dcbde9 drm-xe-next)
Signed-off-by: Pravalika Gurram <pravalika.gurram@intel.com>
Assisted-by: GNAI:gpt-5.3-codex
Signed-off-by: Akanksha Hotta <akanksha.hotta@intel.com>
